From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 07:35:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Unify Admin and ALC login into one common sign-in

Replace the separate Admin/ALC portal tabs with a single login form.
The client no longer sends a trusted role; the backend derives the
account and role from the identifier alone (admin -> username/email,
ALC -> unique ALC code) in one query. Preserves Argon2 verification,
JWT access/refresh tokens, cookies, CSRF, active/inactive checks, and
the must_change_password flow. Uses a generic invalid-credentials
message. Frontend adds an accessible Eye/EyeOff password toggle,
password hidden by default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01911Rkf3ti7rUj3DadvNkay
